sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Farmer
    participant W as Web app
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as Farm-advisory service
    participant D as Data service
    participant O as Open-Meteo
    U->>W: Choose field and season, press Start
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/recommendations (cookie, X-CSRF-Token, Origin)
    G->>G: Validate JWT (JWKS), CSRF, Origin, cookie to Bearer
    G->>A: Forward with Authorization and X-Request-ID
    A->>A: Load field and farm, check ownership
    A->>D: GET /v1/regional/guide (X-Internal-Token)
    D-->>A: Ranked crops by historical prevalence
    A->>D: GET /v1/weather
    D->>O: Fetch forecast (or serve cached)
    O-->>D: Weather data
    D-->>A: LIVE, CACHED or UNAVAILABLE + data
    A->>A: Save recommendation (guide + weather snapshot)
    A-->>G: 201 recommendation
    G-->>W: Response
    W-->>U: Show guide, weather status and limits
